		{
			description: [
				"Ancient Cities are stealth challenges. Bring wool, night vision and an escape route. Sound, not armour, is your first concern."
				"Deeper and Darker extends Ancient City mystery through the Warden and the reinforced-deepslate portal. The Heart of the Deep is a late key, so ordinary city exploration should focus on silence and survival first."
				"The Warden is designed as a boundary more than a normal combat target. Fight only for a deliberate objective, prepare an exit, and never trap teammates in a city while trying to prove damage numbers."
				"Sculk sensors react to vibration and shriekers can escalate toward a Warden. Wool, careful movement, distraction, route planning, and knowing when to stop opening chests are the real early tools."
			]
