			description: [
				"Deeper and Darker makes the Warden drop a Heart of the Deep. Use it inside the Ancient City's reinforced deepslate frame to open the Otherside portal."
				"The installed 1.20.1 line does not consume the heart when the portal is ignited, but protect it until the portal is confirmed stable. Mark both sides and keep wool at the city entrance."
