				"The Otherside adds sculk creatures with different movement, ranged and ambush behaviours. Overcast Pots and their Gloomsherd variants can hold clues and risk rather than ordinary pottery loot."
				"Observe from cover and use Jade to identify each creature. Bring ranged control, wool and escape blocks instead of treating the whole biome as a sword corridor."
